///
/// `__fastcall(ecx = box: *mut f32, edx = resultArray: *mut u32, stack =
/// [queryFlags, outHitFlags])`, `RET 0x8`, bool in AL. The AABB
/// collision-geometry gather driver: bumps the two query counters, resets the
